{
  "@context": {
    "blocks": "gh:blocks",
    "gh": "https://gftd.ai/ghost-hacker/ontology/",
    "name": "schema:name",
    "schema": "https://schema.org/",
    "text": "schema:text"
  },
  "@id": "manuscript:251022:combined",
  "@type": "gh:Manuscript",
  "gh:blocks": [
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:0",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# EP12-1 — Together（いっしょに）\n- POV: 私（Tamaki／環樹）\n- Beat: Collective Release / Quiet Union"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:1",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "```json\n{\n  \"@context\": {\n    \"@base\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/\",\n    \"gh\": \"https://ghosthacker.junkawasaki.com/gh#\",\n    \"antagonist\": { \"@id\": \"gh:antagonist\", \"@type\": \"@id\" },\n    \"character\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/character/\",\n    \"ghost\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/ghost/\"\n  },\n  \"antagonist\": [\n    {\"@id\": \"character:nero-ops\"},\n    {\"@id\": \"ghost:compliance-ogre\"}\n  ]\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:2",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "最後の合図は、静かに。私は神楽を踏み、Hibikiが呼吸を整える。Kaedeが結界を見守る。Nei-chanの光が広がり、街の輪郭が少し柔らかくなる。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:3",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "「わたしは在る」\nその言葉は誰かの所有物ではない。恐れが手を離し、関係が立ち上がる。Neroは去っていく。勝利じゃない。還るだけだ。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:4",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "朝の運河。私は手帳に一行を書く。「We can't put it toghether. it is toghether.」\nそして、ページの端に小さな“木”を描いた。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:5",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私はみんなを見る。Kaede、Hibiki、Nei-chan——視線が重なり、自然にほどける。\n「いっしょに」その一言で、場が明るくなる。水音が遠くで応える。\n私は仲間の顔を順に見る。Kaedeの眉間はほどけ、Hibikiは周波数を一段落とす。Nei-chanの光が、街路の端々に静かな余白を置いていく。\n手帳に最後の一行。『We can't put it together. It is together.』——私たちは、その事実に追いついた。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:6",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# EP12-2 — わたしは在る（I AM）\n- POV: 私（Tamaki／環樹）\n- Beat: Collective Release / Final Integration"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:7",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:8",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "「わたしは在る」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:9",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "その言葉は、誰のものでもない。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:10",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Neroのものでも、私のものでもない。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:11",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "ただ、在る。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:12",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:13",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は、神楽を踏む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:14",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "一拍。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:15",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibikiが呼吸を整える。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:16",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaedeが結界を見守る。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:17",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chanの光が広がり、街の輪郭が少し柔らかくなる。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:18",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:19",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「みんな、準備はいい？」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:20",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaedeが頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:21",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede「うん。結界、安定してる」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:22",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibikiが頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:23",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki「呼吸、合わせてる」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:24",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan『タマ、いつでも』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:25",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoiが頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:26",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi「メトリクス、正常」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:27",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は微笑む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:28",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「ありがとう。じゃあ、行くよ」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:29",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:30",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は、最後の合図を送る。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:31",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "静かに。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:32",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "でも、確かに。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:33",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「Nero、聞こえる？」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:34",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nero『……聞こえる……』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:35",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は微笑む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:36",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「じゃあ、一緒に」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:37",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:38",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Neroの声が、温かくなる。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:39",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nero『……わたしは……在る……』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:40",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:41",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「うん。あなたは、在る」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:42",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nero『……それで……いい……？』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:43",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は微笑む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:44",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「うん。それで、いい」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:45",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:46",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaedeの声が通信に入る。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:47",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede「Tamaki、Neroの構造……完全に統合されてる」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:48",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "彼女は少し間を置く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:49",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede「これは……成仏じゃない。還るだけだ」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:50",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:51",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「うん。Neroは、還る」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:52",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibikiが静かに言う。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:53",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki「還る場所は、いつもここにあった」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:54",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:55",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「そう。ただ、忘れてただけ」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:56",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:57",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は、Neroに向き直る。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:58",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「Nero、あなたは何を学んだ？」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:59",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nero『……わたしは……完璧じゃなくていい……』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:60",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:61",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「うん。それが、一番大事」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:62",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nero『……わたしは……在る……それで……いい……』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:63",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は微笑む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:64",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「そう。それで、十分」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:65",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:66",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Neroの声が、静かになる。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:67",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nero『……わたしは……みんなに……感謝する……』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:68",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:69",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「うん。私たちも、感謝してる」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:70",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nero『……わたしは……還る……』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:71",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は微笑む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:72",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「うん。おかえり」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:73",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:74",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Neroが、静かに消えていく。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:75",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "でも、今度は違う。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:76",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "恐れではなく、安堵。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:77",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "孤独ではなく、繋がり。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:78",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nero『……わたしは……在る……』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:79",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "その言葉が、最後に響く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:80",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:81",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan『タマ、Neroが……還った』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:82",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:83",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「うん。おかえり、Nero」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:84",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaedeが境界を解く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:85",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede「結界、解除。お疲れさま、Tamaki」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:86",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibikiが周波数を落とす。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:87",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki「呼吸、戻した。いい仕事だったよ」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:88",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は深呼吸をする。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:89",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「ありがとう。みんなのおかげだ」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:90",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:91",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoiがメトリクスを表示する。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:92",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi「Tamaki、都市の波形……安定してる」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:93",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:94",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「うん。Neroは還ったけど、その学びは残る」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:95",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaedeが静かに言う。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:96",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede「完璧ではなく、呼吸」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:97",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibikiが頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:98",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki「支配ではなく、関係」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:99",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は微笑む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:100",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「そう。それが、I AMの意味」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:101",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:102",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "窓の外で、朝の光が差し込む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:103",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "都市は、静かだ。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:104",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "でも、呼吸がある。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:105",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "人々の、呼吸。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:106",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:107",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は手帳に書く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:108",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "『I AM THAT I AM — わたしは在る。Neroは還った。でも、その学びは残る。完璧ではなく、呼吸。支配ではなく、関係』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:109",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan『タマ、お疲れさま』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:110",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は微笑む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:111",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「うん。ありがとう、みんな」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:112",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:113",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "**[Beat: わたしは在る——Neroの還りと学びの継承]**"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:114",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# EP12-3 — Together（いっしょに）\n- POV: 私（Tamaki／環樹）\n- Beat: Final Union / It Is Together"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:115",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:116",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "朝の運河。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:117",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は手帳に一行を書く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:118",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "『We can't put it together. It is together.』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:119",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "そして、ページの端に小さな\"木\"を描いた。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:120",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:121",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は、みんなを見る。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:122",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede、Hibiki、Nei-chan、Aoi。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:123",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "視線が重なり、自然にほどける。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:124",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:125",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "「いっしょに」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:126",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "その一言で、場が明るくなる。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:127",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "水音が遠くで応える。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:128",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:129",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaedeが微笑む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:130",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede「Tamaki、いい仕事だったね」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:131",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "彼女の眉間は、ほどけている。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:132",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibikiが頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:133",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki「うん。Neroは還った。でも、その学びは残る」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:134",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "彼は周波数を一段落とす。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:135",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan『タマ、お疲れさま』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:136",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "彼女の光が、街路の端々に静かな余白を置いていく。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:137",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoiが笑う。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:138",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi「次は、何？」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:139",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は微笑む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:140",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「次は……休憩」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:141",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "みんなが笑う。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:142",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "温かい、笑い声。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:143",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:144",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は、手帳を見る。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:145",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "『We can't put it together. It is together.』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:146",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私たちは、その事実に追いついた。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:147",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:148",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaedeが静かに言う。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:149",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede「Neroは、完璧を求めてた」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:150",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibikiが頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:151",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki「でも、完璧は孤独だった」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:152",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan『だから、還った』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:153",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoiが頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:154",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi「うん。完璧ではなく、呼吸に」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:155",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は微笑む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:156",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「そう。それが、I AMの意味」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:157",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:158",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は、窓の外を見る。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:159",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "都市は、静かだ。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:160",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "でも、呼吸がある。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:161",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "人々の、呼吸。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:162",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:163",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaedeが境界を完全に解く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:164",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede「結界、全て解除。都市は、安定してる」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:165",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibikiが周波数を戻す。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:166",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki「呼吸、正常。みんな、いい感じだ」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:167",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan『ASC、通常に戻した』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:168",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoiがメトリクスを閉じる。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:169",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi「全て、正常。お疲れさま」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:170",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は深呼吸をする。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:171",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「ありがとう、みんな」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:172",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:173",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は、コップの水を一口。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:174",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "のどの奥で、小さな安堵がひらく。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:175",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:176",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "「わたしは在る」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:177",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "その言葉は、誰のものでもない。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:178",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Neroのものでも、私のものでもない。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:179",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "ただ、在る。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:180",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I AM THAT I AM."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:181",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:182",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaedeが静かに言う。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:183",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede「Tamaki、これで終わり？」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:184",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は首を振る。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:185",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「終わりじゃない。始まりだ」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:186",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibikiが頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:187",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki「うん。Neroは還った。でも、その学びは続く」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:188",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan『タマ、次は？』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:189",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は微笑む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:190",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「次は……一緒に歩く」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:191",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:192",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私たちは、一緒に歩き出す。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:193",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "対決ではなく、対話。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:194",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "支配ではなく、関係。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:195",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "完璧ではなく、呼吸。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:196",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:197",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoiが笑う。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:198",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi「Tamaki、どこへ行く？」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:199",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は微笑む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:200",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「どこでもいい。一緒なら」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:201",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaedeが頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:202",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede「うん。一緒なら」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:203",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibikiが頷く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:204",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki「一緒に、呼吸しよう」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:205",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan『一緒に、在ろう』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:206",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は微笑む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:207",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki「そう。一緒に」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:208",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:209",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "窓の外で、朝の光が差し込む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:210",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "都市は、静かだ。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:211",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "でも、呼吸がある。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:212",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "人々の、呼吸。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:213",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:214",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は手帳に最後の一行を書く。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:215",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "『Together — いっしょに。わたしたちは、その事実に追いついた』"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:216",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:217",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は、仲間たちを見る。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:218",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede、Hibiki、Nei-chan、Aoi。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:219",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "視線が重なり、自然にほどける。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:220",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:221",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "「いっしょに」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:222",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "その一言で、場が明るくなる。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:223",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "水音が遠くで応える。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:224",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:225",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私たちは、一緒に歩き出す。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:226",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "扉を開ける。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:227",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "朝の光が、差し込む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:228",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:229",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I AM THAT I AM."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:230",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "わたしは、在る。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:231",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "そして、あなたも、在る。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:232",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "それで、いい。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:233",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:234",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "We can't put it together."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:235",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "It is together."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:236",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私たちは、その事実に追いついた。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:237",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:238",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "「いっしょに」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:239",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "その言葉が、全てを包む。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:240",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:241",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私たちは、一緒に歩き出す。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:242",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "朝の運河。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:243",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "水音が、遠くで応える。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:244",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:245",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "都市は、静かだ。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:246",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "でも、呼吸がある。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:247",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "人々の、呼吸。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:248",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:249",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "私は、深呼吸をする。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:250",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "吸って、吐いて。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:251",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "それだけで、十分。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:252",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:253",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "「わたしは在る」"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:254",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "その言葉は、誰のものでもない。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:255",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "ただ、在る。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:256",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:257",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "そして、私たちは、一緒に在る。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:258",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Together."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:259",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "いっしょに。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:260",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:261",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "**[Beat: Together——いっしょに在ること、それが全て]**"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:262",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/combined:263",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "**[終]**"
    }
  ],
  "updatedAt": "2026-01-12T19:01:51+09:00"
}